  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The idea for this work was to make an illustrated catalogue of visual proposals that deal with gastronomy and cuisine, including, among others: menus, salads, main courses, soups, tacos, sauces and drinks; a whole series of home recipes, bizarre recipes, appetizers, desserts, different kinds of bread and snacks; national, international and municipal food. On the whole, the idea we bore in mind for this edition was to organize a whole collection of dishes with the purpose of creating a recipe book with drawings, texts, anecdotes and accurate instructions on how to have a(n) healthy/unhealthy diet."--MoNDAo Corp. Web site (viewed Nov. 2, 2009).</subfield>
  </datafield>
